These devices lost bindings they had before:

{devices}

This happens when a device is factory reset, re-paired, or loses its binding table after a firmware update. A remote or switch then stops controlling its lights.{paused}

Submit binds them again with zha-toolkit and reads each device back to check. Battery devices usually don't answer straight away: their bindings go back on their next button press.{card_link}{result}
